description: Shared ABI source for compiler/runtime handoff types and host import names
includes:
  - crates/sigil-abi/src/
excludes:
  - crates/sigil-abi/target/
context: |
  This scope is the implementation-level view of the shared ABI crate.
  Keep the surface minimal: stable import names, runtime type descriptions,
  actor/handler/module metadata, and tiny helper methods that make the
  compiler/runtime seam easier to debug.

  Avoid adding compiler semantics or runtime behavior here. This crate should
  remain a narrow typed boundary between producer and consumer crates.
related:
  - crates/sigil-abi/.scope
  - crates/sigil-compiler/.scope
  - crates/sigil-runtime/.scope
tags:
  - abi
  - src
  - shared
  - host
